# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# each contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Workflow files here embed bash
# scripts that run on Linux (ubuntu-latest) runners — a stray \r from CRLF
# checked into the blob can silently break string comparisons, case patterns,
# etc. in those scripts, so this isn't just cosmetic.
* text=auto eol=lf
